## Migration summary

- Schema: `forms`
- Catalog tables (tenant-less, SELECT-only for app_role):
  - `forms.templates` (key UNIQUE, standards CHECK ⊆ {ISO9001,ISO14001,ISO45001,IMS}, maps_to CHECK)
  - `forms.template_sections` (template_id FK, sort_order)
  - `forms.template_fields` (section_id FK, field_type CHECK 10 types, relation_requires_target CHECK, maps_to_column, sort_order)
- Tenant tables (full DML under RLS):
  - `forms.records` (tenant_id, template_id FK, status CHECK 5 states, opened_by, completed_by/at, approved_by/at, m2_nc_id, m4_record_id)
  - `forms.record_values` (record_id FK, tenant_id, field_id FK, exactly_one_value CHECK, UNIQUE(record_id, field_id), partial indexes on value_uuid/value_date)
- RLS: ENABLE + FORCE + tenant_isolation policy on records + record_values
- Grants: USAGE on schema; SELECT on catalog; SIDUD on tenant tables

